			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1404764">
									

<p>There are so many typos in this.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-1845 is a male American red fox (vulpes vulpes fulvus), approximately 3 years old at the time it entered Foundation custody in 20.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Does this mean 'custody in 20&#8212;' like a date or year?</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Physiologically SCP-1845 is similar to most wild-born foxes of its age, bearing several scares on its abdomen and limbs from fights.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Scares.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>A small hatchet with a wooden handle and a sharpened piece of flint for its haft.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Is haft even a word? It seems to be, according to my spellcheck. But I'm pretty sure you don't mean haft.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>The origin of SCP-1845' knowledge and abilities is unknown.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Seems to be missing an s here.</p>
<p>In other news, this SCP was just a fox taken out of a children's book.</p>

